    "title": "DLF Ltd.",
    "slug": "dlf-ltd",
    "description": "DLF Ltd. is one of India’s oldest and most respected real estate companies with nearly eight decades of experience across residential, commercial, and mixed-use developments. From early colonies in Delhi to major urban centers across India, DLF’s portfolio includes iconic spaces like luxury homes, business parks, retail centres, and integrated townships. The company emphasizes quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction with a reputation for trend-setting design, scale, and delivery reliability. (Real Estate Consultant in Delhi NCR)",
    "image": "/images/1771842001113-DLF.png",
    "metaTitle": "DLF Ltd – Premier Indian Real Estate Developer",
    "metaDescription": "Discover DLF Ltd’s legacy of residential and commercial developments across India with quality and excellence.",
