    "title": "M3M India",
    "slug": "m3m-india",
    "description": "M3M India is one of India’s fastest-growing real estate developers with a strong focus on luxury residential and commercial properties, especially in Delhi NCR. Known for quality construction, modern design, and timely delivery, M3M has shaped luxury living with iconic projects across Gurugram, Noida, and Panipat, redefining premium lifestyles with world-class amenities and architectural excellence. (M3M India Pvt. Ltd.)",
