    "title": "ELAN",
    "slug": "elan",
    "description": "Elan Group is a Gurugram-based real estate developer known for high-end commercial, retail, and luxury residential projects. Established over a decade ago, Elan has built a strong presence in the Delhi NCR region with landmark developments along Golf Course Extension Road and Dwarka Expressway. The company is recognized for innovative architectural design, premium positioning, and strategic project locations. With projects such as Elan Epic, Elan The Mark, and Elan The Presidential, the brand focuses on delivering modern infrastructure, upscale amenities, and lifestyle-oriented developments that cater to investors and luxury homebuyers alike.",
