    "title": "Smartworld",
    "slug": "smartworld",
    "description": "Smartworld Developers is a new-age real estate company founded in 2020 with a focus on innovation, transparency, and customer-centric development. Headquartered in Gurugram, Smartworld specializes in residential and mixed-use projects designed for modern urban lifestyles. The brand emphasizes flexible payment plans, contemporary architecture, and smart living concepts. With multiple ongoing projects along Golf Course Extension Road and Dwarka Expressway, Smartworld aims to redefine real estate experiences by integrating technology, sustainability, and design efficiency into every development.",
