    "title": "Krisumi",
    "slug": "krisumi",
    "description": "Krisumi Corporation is a premium real estate joint venture between Krishna Group of India and Sumitomo Corporation of Japan. Established in 2018, the company brings Japanese precision, design philosophy, and quality standards to Indian real estate. Krisumi focuses on luxury residential developments in Gurugram, with flagship projects like Waterfall Residences in Sector 36A along Dwarka Expressway. The brand emphasizes minimalistic architecture, global construction standards, sustainable planning, and community-centric living. By combining Japanese craftsmanship with Indian market understanding, Krisumi aims to redefine high-end urban living through thoughtful design and long-term value creation.",
