    "title": "Max Estates Ltd.",
    "slug": "max-estates-ltd",
    "description": "Max Estates Ltd is the real estate development arm of the Max Group, established in 2016 and focused on sustainable residential, commercial, and mixed-use developments in the Delhi NCR region. The brand emphasizes wellness-centric design, high-quality construction, and modern community living concepts. Its portfolio includes Grade-A office spaces such as Max Towers and Max House, and expansive residential masterplans like Estate 360 along key growth corridors like Dwarka Expressway. Max Estates combines contemporary architecture, sustainability, and innovation to provide quality spaces for work and life.",
    "image": "/images/1771842523437-Max_Estates.png",
