    "title": "Sobha Limited",
    "slug": "sobha-limited",
    "description": "Sobha Limited is a major Indian real estate developer headquartered in Bengaluru with a strong track record of delivering premium residential and commercial projects since 1995. The company is known for its backward integration model — controlling the entire development process from design to delivery — ensuring superior quality and craftsmanship. With more than 450 completed projects across 27+ cities, Sobha focuses on sustainable, innovative, and high-quality construction. Its projects often incorporate green building practices and have earned industry awards and recognition. (SOBHA Limited)",
    "image": "/images/1771842588144-Sobha.png",
    "metaTitle": "Sobha Limited – Premium Real Estate Developer in India",
    "metaDescription": "Discover Sobha Limited’s extensive portfolio of residential and commercial projects across India, known for craftsmanship, quality, and sustainability.",
