    "title": "Puri Constructions Pvt. Ltd.",
    "slug": "puri-constructions-pvt-ltd",
    "description": "Puri Constructions is a well-established real estate developer with a legacy spanning over five decades. Known for luxury residential and commercial projects in the Delhi NCR region — particularly in Gurgaon and Faridabad — the company has delivered thousands of homes and continues to craft high-end projects with modern design, premium amenities, and thoughtful planning. Puri’s portfolio includes landmark developments like Emerald Bay, Palm Springs, and The Aravallis, blending comfort with strategic locations.",
