    "title": "Central Park Group",
    "slug": "central-park-group",
    "description": "Central Park Group is a diversified real estate and lifestyle developer focused on delivering luxury residential and mixed-use spaces integrated with hospitality services and premium amenities. With over two decades of experience, the brand is known for concept-driven developments in Gurugram, Delhi NCR, and Goa that offer residents a blend of design, comfort, and community. Central Park’s projects prioritize quality, intelligent planning, and enhanced living experiences. (Central Park - Luxury housing)",
