    "slug": "emaar-india",
    "description": "Emaar India is the Indian subsidiary of UAE-based Emaar Properties, operating since 2005 in cities like Gurugram, Lucknow, Mohali, and Indore. The company builds integrated townships, residential multistoried buildings, commercial spaces, and lifestyle developments. Known for quality and design innovation, Emaar India has earned multiple awards for excellence over the years and continues its footprint across key urban markets with a focus on sustainability and customer-centric living environments. (Wikipedia)",
