    "title": "Signature Global",
    "slug": "signature-global",
    "description": "Signature Global is a top real estate developer in northern India, reshaping affordable and mid-segment housing markets with quality, sustainable design, and innovation. Since its inception in 2014, the company has delivered 50+ residential and mixed-use projects, serving over 31,000 families with modern homes, premium amenities, and eco-friendly features. Signature Global’s portfolio spans Gurugram and the Delhi NCR region, focused on balancing affordability with elegance and long-term community value. It actively pursues green practices with IGBC and EDGE certifications. (Signature Global)",
    "image": "/images/1771842898239-Signature_Global.png",
    "metaTitle": "Signature Global – Leading Real Estate Developer in India",
    "metaDescription": "Explore Signature Global’s affordable and sustainable housing projects across Delhi NCR, delivering quality homes with modern amenities.",
