    "slug": "godrej-properties",
    "description": "Godrej Properties is a trusted Indian real estate developer established in 1990 and headquartered in Mumbai. A subsidiary of Godrej Industries Group, it has delivered numerous residential, commercial, and township projects across top Indian cities, including Mumbai, Pune, Bengaluru, and Delhi NCR. The company is known for quality construction, integrated design, and sustainable communities with a strong market reputation and a customer-centric development approach. (Wikipedia)",
