    "title": "Omaxe Limited",
    "slug": "omaxe-limited",
    "description": "Omaxe Ltd. is one of India’s leading real estate development companies with over three decades of experience in delivering residential, commercial, and integrated township projects across the country. Founded in 1987 by Rohtas Goel, the company has built a strong reputation for quality construction, timely delivery, and large-scale urban development.\r\n\r\nHeadquartered in New Delhi, Omaxe has successfully developed projects across major cities including Gurugram, Noida, Lucknow, Chandigarh, Indore, and New Chandigarh. The company has delivered a wide range of developments such as residential apartments, luxury villas, shopping malls, commercial hubs, and integrated townships.\r\n\r\nWith a customer-centric approach and focus on innovation, Omaxe continues to shape modern urban living through premium developments that combine design, infrastructure, and lifestyle amenities.",
    "image": "/images/1772705239644-Omaxe_Ltd.png",
    "metaTitle": "Omaxe Ltd – Leading Real Estate Developer in India",
    "metaDescription": "Explore Omaxe Ltd., one of India’s leading real estate developers delivering residential, commercial, and township projects across major cities.",
