    "title": "Prestige Group",
    "slug": "prestige-group",
    "description": "Prestige Group is one of India’s leading real estate developers, known for delivering premium residential, commercial, retail, and hospitality developments across major cities. Founded in 1986 and headquartered in Bengaluru, the company has built a strong reputation for quality construction, innovative design, and timely project delivery.\r\n\r\nOver the years, Prestige Group has developed landmark projects in cities such as Bengaluru, Chennai, Hyderabad, Mumbai, and Kochi. The developer’s portfolio includes luxury residences, integrated townships, office parks, shopping malls, and hotels.\r\n\r\nWith decades of experience and numerous award-winning developments, Prestige Group continues to shape modern urban living with high-quality projects that combine comfort, sustainability, and world-class amenities.",
