    "title": "Reach Group",
    "slug": "reach-group",
    "description": "Reach Group is a prominent real estate developer in India known for delivering premium commercial and retail developments across major cities. Headquartered in Gurugram, the company focuses on creating modern business hubs, high-street retail destinations, and mixed-use developments designed to meet evolving urban lifestyle and commercial needs.\r\n\r\nWith a strong emphasis on quality construction, strategic locations, and innovative design, Reach Group has developed several landmark commercial projects that combine retail, office spaces, and lifestyle amenities. The developer is recognized for creating vibrant business environments that attract leading brands, retailers, and corporate tenants.\r\n\r\nThrough its customer-centric approach and commitment to excellence, Reach Group continues to contribute to the growth of India’s commercial real estate landscape.",
